menu "Klivox temperature sensor"

    config KLIVOX_TEMPERATURE_GPIO
        int "DS18B20 1-Wire GPIO"
        range 0 48
        default 18
        help
            Use an available input/output GPIO, with an external 4.7 kOhm
            pull-up to 3.3 V. GPIO18 is the default for Klivox Wired ESP32.
            Select a suitable GPIO when reusing this component on another board.

    config KLIVOX_TEMPERATURE_PERIOD_SECONDS
        int "Temperature sampling period (seconds)"
        range 1 3600
        default 5
        help
            Start a measurement every configured period. Conversion waits
            inside the sensor task, without blocking app_main or event callbacks.

endmenu
